{"id":"n64780-3-10","stage":2,"title":"몰리다 · 聚集","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64780-3-10-1","ko":"감기가 유행인가 봐.","zh":"看来感冒正在流行呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"감기가","meaning":"感冒","explanation":"감기：感冒；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"감기","audio":"/audio/2c4cdf56b777f3677c17.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28635","senseId":"1","lemma":"감기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"감기가","audio":"/audio/d900d01cd84038266b50.mp3"}},{"text":"유행인가","meaning":"流行","explanation":"유행：流行；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"유행","audio":"/audio/4e036fa50e83b243700b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70900","senseId":"2","lemma":"유행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유행인가","audio":"/audio/7808ef540e4708f9700e.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2c4cdf56b777f367","term":"감기","zh":"感冒","audio":"/audio/2c4cdf56b777f3677c17.mp3","entryId":"28635","definition":"一般伴有咳嗽、流鼻涕、头痛、发冷等症状的传染病。","pronunciation":["감ː기"]},{"id":"4e036fa50e83b243","term":"유행","zh":"流行","audio":"/audio/4e036fa50e83b243700b.mp3","entryId":"70900","definition":"传染病广泛传播。","pronunciation":["유행"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/914b49e1cc97325e1715.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64780-3-10-2","ko":"응, 병원에 갔더니 사람들이 어찌나 몰리던지.","zh":"嗯，我去医院的时候，那儿挤满了人。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"병원에","meaning":"医院","explanation":"병원：医院；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"병원","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62271","senseId":"1","lemma":"병원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"병원에","audio":"/audio/2610e1319b7ca0517a20.mp3"}},{"text":"갔더니","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갔더니","audio":"/audio/5f705b64c8e27a99e60e.mp3"}},{"text":"사람들이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람들이","audio":"/audio/42e5b243df0b3ed051af.mp3"}},{"text":"어찌나","meaning":"太，过分地","explanation":"어찌나：太，过分地","readings":[{"term":"어찌나","audio":"/audio/2ec28fbd146036c935fc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15093","senseId":"1","lemma":"어찌나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어찌나","audio":"/audio/2ec28fbd146036c935fc.mp3"}},{"text":"몰리던지.","meaning":"聚集","explanation":"몰리다：聚集；던지：回顾过去并强调程度很高，后面的结果可省略。","readings":[{"term":"몰리다","audio":"/audio/919a152ad89ce04d9f01.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64780","senseId":"3","lemma":"몰리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몰리던지","audio":"/audio/c4f9d40c9b8db66b674b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"i